**`RECOMMENDED_MODELS.md`** — Full rewrite documenting:
- Active model: Gemma 4 E2B Q5_K_M (upgraded from Q4_K_M)
- Quantization comparison table
- Alternative models (Llama 3.2, Phi-3.5, Mistral 7B)
- Step-by-step setup instructions
- All server flags explained
- Cloud fallback provider chain

