---

## How to Start MIRA

```
1. run.bat              ← starts everything (llama server + MCP + Flask UI)
   — or —
2. start_llama_server.bat   ← inference engine only
   run.bat                  ← rest of stack
```

> **Note**: The Q4_K_M model is still in the folder — it's not deleted. You can switch back by editing the `--model` path in `start_llama_server.bat`.
